## Test Infrastructure & Recommended Location

**Smallest established test pattern for canvas-theme-editor runtime behavior:**

### Recommended Test File Location
[packages/scaffold/templates/canvas-theme-editor/tests/theme-switching.test.ts](packages/scaffold/templates/canvas-theme-editor/tests/theme-switching.test.ts)
*(new file — no existing runtime tests yet)*

### Test Environment Setup
Use `@vitest-environment happy-dom` — same as [formats/interactions/tests](formats/interactions/tests). Examples:
- [modal.test.ts](formats/interactions/tests/modal.test.ts) — fixture setup, DOM state verification
- [tooltip.test.ts](formats/interactions/tests/tooltip.test.ts) — event dispatch, timer-based changes
- [shared.test.ts](formats/interactions/tests/shared.test.ts) — helper functions with DOM queries

### Recommended Test Structure

```typescript
// @vitest-environment happy-dom
import { afterEach, expect, test, vi } from "vite-plus/test";
// Import functions from generated main.ts.tmpl (requires build step)

afterEach(() => {
  document.body.innerHTML = "";
  vi.useRealTimers();
});

test("applyChromeColor() cascades custom color style over rebrand base", () => {
  // Fixture: load rebrand theme CSS, set initial color
  // Action: call applyChromeColor("blue")
  // Assert: document.documentElement.dataset.pantokenColor === "blue"
  // Assert: computed style reflects color token via [data-pantoken-color] selector
});

test("applyEditorTheme() swaps TinyMCE skin CSS on canvas theme switch", () => {
  // Fixture: mock TinyMCE editor with document.head
  // Action: applyEditorTheme(mockEditor) with canvas theme URLs
  // Assert: old skin link removed, new canvas skin link appended
  // Assert: editor.getDoc().head contains content CSS link
});

test("postMessage handler (pantoken-demo-theme) updates chrome without blanking editor", () => {
  // Fixture: set up DOM with editor mock, message handler attached
  // Action: simulate window.postMessage({type: "pantoken-demo-theme", theme: "canvas", ...})
  // Assert: applyEditorTheme was called
  // Assert: document state consistent (no removed editor)
});
```

### Existing Verified Test Files for Reference

| File | Pattern | Use For |
|------|---------|---------|
| [packages/scaffold/tests/index.test.ts](packages/scaffold/tests/index.test.ts#L97) | Template string assertions | Verify generated main.ts contains expected code |
| [formats/interactions/tests/modal.test.ts](formats/interactions/tests/modal.test.ts) | `happy-dom` + fixture HTML + state assertions | Color cascade and editor state |
| [formats/interactions/tests/tooltip.test.ts](formats/interactions/tests/tooltip.test.ts) | Event dispatch + fake timers | postMessage handler timing |
| [formats/interactions/tests/shared.test.ts](formats/interactions/tests/shared.test.ts) | Helper function testing | `resolveSpace()` token lookup analogy |

### Recommended Assertions

**For custom color style cascade order:**
```typescript
// Before: chrome uses rebrand defaults
expect(document.documentElement.dataset.pantokenScheme).toBe("light");
// After applyChromeColor("blue"):
expect(document.documentElement.dataset.pantokenColor).toBe("blue");
// CSS with [data-pantoken-color="blue"] should take precedence over rebrand
// Verify via computed style or inline style attribute
```

**For TinyMCE theme switching without blanking:**
```typescript
// Before switch
const oldSkin = document.head.querySelector("link[href*='rebrand']");
// After applyEditorTheme(editor) with canvas URLs
expect(oldSkin).toBe(null); // Old removed
expect(document.head.querySelector("link[href*='canvas']")).toBeTruthy();
// Editor document still has content
expect(editor.getContent()).not.toBe(""); // Or mock getContent() to verify not blanked
```

### Key Source Locations (Read-Only)
- **Theme application logic:** [main.ts.tmpl L214–260](packages/scaffold/templates/canvas-theme-editor/src/main.ts.tmpl#L214-L260)
- **postMessage handler:** [main.ts.tmpl L264–283](packages/scaffold/templates/canvas-theme-editor/src/main.ts.tmpl#L264-L283)
- **Parent broadcasts:** [docs/.vitepress/theme/theme.ts L166–191](docs/.vitepress/theme/theme.ts#L166-L191)
- **Editor theme URLs:** [main.ts.tmpl L58–63](packages/scaffold/templates/canvas-theme-editor/src/main.ts.tmpl#L58-L63)

